          The inlet box is the cheapest part of a generator hookup and the one that decides which plug fits, how much power gets through and where the generator sits. Here are the seven worth buying, matched to the outlet on your generator.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="#reliance-pb30"
