        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block ml-auto">
          <SocialProof users="6.4k" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#what-it-is" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. What an Inlet Box Does</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. The 7 Best, Ranked</a>
          <a href="#thirty-vs-fifty" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. 30A L14-30 vs 50A</a>
          <a href="#materials" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Enclosures and NEMA 3R</a>
          <a href="#pairing" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Interlock or Transfer Switch</a>
          <a href="#placement" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Where to Mount It</a>
          <a href="#kits" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Kits With a Cord</a>
          <a href="#install" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Permits and Install</a>
          <a href="#which-generator" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. Which Generator, Which Inlet</a>
          <a href="#skip" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. When It Is Not Worth It</a>
          <a href="#mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">11. Common Mistakes</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">12. FAQ</a>
